OL,3,GNEWSASurrey Day set to be 'biggest and
OL,4,Abest yet'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurrey Day 2027 is set to be the
OL,7,F"biggest and best" celebration yet,
OL,8,Forganisers have said, as they unveil
OL,9,Fnext year's theme and date.
OL,11,FThe ninth annual celebration of life in
OL,12,Fthe county will take place on 8 May and
OL,13,Fbe themed 'Inspirational Surrey'.
OL,15,FOrganisers said the event would
OL,16,Fcelebrate a county that has inspired
OL,17,Fgenerations of artists, writers,
OL,18,Fmusicians and creative minds.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
